    "AI Notes": {
      "value": "FRAME (Frame Cph), Copenhagen 3D/CGI motion studio founded 2003, specialising in conceptual product films for luxury brands; ~20+ years operating. Clients: Balenciaga, Zegna, Hublot, B&B Italia, Montblanc, TAG Heuer, Bang & Olufsen, Louis Poulsen, Jaguar/Range Rover. Highly specialised hands-on 3D/animation team, so classified Studio (not Agency despite the clip note label). Studio-level autonomy (5): directs and produces end to end. Work Status Studio: self-describing on frame.dk (own studio) and LinkedIn company page both confirm studio entity. Headcount: LinkedIn lists 11-50 employees (updated from prior estimate of 2-10). IG @frame_cph confirmed via their own site listing. LinkedIn confirmed via google snippet (dk.linkedin.com/company/frame-cph). Public email info@frame.dk from frame.dk/contact. Capabilities and clients from frame.dk and Behance.",
